# Build hygiene (ym752): backups must never ship in the image. A bare `*.bak*` only
# matches the build-context root, so the **/ variants are the ones that cover
# packages/**/src backups (the ym739 image leak).
*.bak*
*.bak-*
**/*.bak*
**/*.bak-*

# Build-context diet (K6, 2026-10-22): mirror-fidelity/ and collector output are data,
# not image content. Measured before: 328MB context (mirror-fidelity 182MB + collectors 95MB).
mirror-fidelity/
scripts/collectors/out/
scripts/collectors/logs/
scripts/collectors/state/
